# Jitter of train members at 10x during a Starmind deployment (2026-10-19): the selected member's screen position
# and GPU-vs-CPU range per frame, with the pre-fix launch records (`launch legacy on`) and the new ones; then the
# GPU / CPU photometric parity of a member while it unfolds (state par1-4: selection.parity, photometry.unfold).
launch deploy filter=Starmind
wait 5
launch select kind=upper
follow offset=-200,500,-60
time add 300
wait 3
follow aimat=-100,0,120
wait 30
launch select kind=train member=0
time scale 10x
time play
launch legacy on
wait 20
wait 1
